{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00602","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 雍和 · 魏徵、褚亮","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 雍和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崇兹享祀，诚敬兼至。\n乐以感灵，礼以昭事。\n粢盛咸絜，牲牷孔备。\n永言孝思，庶几不匮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵、褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}